					}

					ZebraSwallowtail: {
						Flavor: A butterfly which, at one point, was purely native to the vast savannahs a ways west-southwest from Turean outskirts. Over time, it migrated to cooler climates with more abundant flowery foods...though it gave up its one preferred large prey, and thus, the primary use case of its camouflage.

						WeightGain1: {
