					}

					Julia: {
						Flavor: Grand Bismarke Julia Lesenta Halrise XVII, the tyrannical and titanically fat overlord of Old Sveetia, was put to gastric rest by one of this species of butterfly as the focal point of an assassination plot to overthrow the cruel woman. It has been coined the Julia butterfly ever since.

						WeightGain1: {
