					[c/{$Mods.V2.Colors.BadThingVore}:Your stomach is about to end up quantum-superimposed on itself.]
					[c/{$Mods.V2.Colors.BadThingVore}:Don't drink shimmer without a way to prevent this outcome.]
					'Fool you once, shame on me. Fool you twice...'
					'''
			}

			Softened: {
				Name: Softened

				Description: {
					Base:
						'''
						A stack of this debuff is applied for every [c/{$Mods.V2.Colors.BadThingVore}:{SoftenedMaxHealthThreshold} of your BASE maximum health you take in digestion damage]
						Up to [c/{$Mods.V2.Colors.BadThingVore}:{SoftenedMaxStacks}] can be applied on you (current: [c/{$Mods.V2.Colors.BadThingVore}:{SoftenedStacks}])
						[c/{$Mods.V2.Colors.BadThingVore}:Decreases defense by {SoftenedDefReduction}] per stack (current: [c/{$Mods.V2.Colors.BadThingVore}:{SoftenedCurrentDefReduction}])
						[c/{$Mods.V2.Colors.BadThingVore}:Increases taken digestion damage by {SoftenedDigestiveAid}] per stack, after all other modifiers including defense (current: [c/{$Mods.V2.Colors.BadThingVore}:{SoftenedCurrentDigestiveAid}])
						'''

					Flavor: {
						0: You've stayed acid-free for a good while, haven't you?
						1: You feel a light itch in a few places
						2: You're starting to itch a good deal more
						3: Your skin is starting to sting, badly
						4: Your skin feels like it's burning
						5: You feel patches of skin starting to decay
						6: Your skin is starting to melt off
						7: Your predator's stomach has picked up the pace now
						8: The muscles beneath your bones are melting away now
						9: You can barely fight the acidic onslaught anymore
						10: Say your goodbyes; they're more likely to escape this gut than you are
					}
				}
			}

			SoreThroat: {
				Name: Sore Throat
				Description:
					'''
					[c/{$Mods.V2.Colors.BadThingVore}:Prevents swallowing anything orally]
					Does not stop other methods of consumption
					'Something's bothering your throat pretty bad'
					'''
			}

			TastySweet: {
				Name: Sweet Taste
				Description:
					'''
					[c/{$Mods.V2.Colors.GoodThingVore}:Makes you taste] [c/FF7FBF:sweet]
