			4: "{0} decided to bulk up {1}'s booty a little."
			5: "{0} filled out {1}'s hips a good bit."
		}

		SlimePred: {
			1: "{0} wanted to eat a tasty dessert, but ended up part of one instead."
			2: A wobbly {1} managed to dissolve {0}.
			3: "{0} melted into more of a {1}."
		}

		SpecificNPC: {
			Forest: {
				Zombie: {
					1: "{0}'s brain, and the rest of them, was eaten by {1}."
					2: "{0} thought {1}'s stomach stopped working after they died. They were then proven very wrong."
					3: "{0} couldn't even make it out of a weak, shambling zombie's gut."
					Hardcore:
						'''
						Zombies often seek fresh life to devour and make their own, being too stupid to realize it won't make them alive again.
						Of course, {0} unfortunately ended up in the crossfire of this eternal hunt for new life to eat.
						Their legacy will be short-lived, as will their undead predator. Zombies really aren't hard to fight for most...
						'''
				}

				Pinky: {
					1: A Pinky turned {0} into some pretty pink gel.
					2: "{0} got a little too into a cute little Pinky."
					Hardcore:
						'''
						The Pinky is often seen as one of the weakest species of slime, and for good reason.
						Their small size makes it difficult for them to ever devour human-sized prey or larger.
						So how, then, did {0}'s only life manage to get ended by one of these tiny little treats?
						At least whatever, or WHOever, eats their new home will be getting a VERY filling dessert...
						'''
				}
			}

			Cavern: {
				Nymph: {
					1: "{0} was lured too close by the tempting frame of a nymph."
					2: All it took was one sultry glance from a nymph for {0} to get churned.
					Hardcore:
						'''
						Within the deeper caverns, {0} happened across a lost girl in need of food.
						Upon closer inspection, she turned out to be a gluttonous nymph in need of her next meal.
						She cared little for the fact they couldn't reform; she only cared about getting her breakfast.
						All that will remain of them once she's done is a new layer of fat on the nymph's more attractive features.
						After all, the curvier and chubbier she is, the easier she can lure in future prey...
						'''
				}
			}

			Sky: {
				Harpy: {
					1: "{0} was snatched out of the sky by a hungry harpy girl."
					2: A harpy swooped in to snack on {0}, and left with a hearty meal in tow.
					3: The early bird caught the {0}.
					4: "{0} might be weighing down a harpy a bit too much to fly for a while."
					5: "{0} went birdwatching the wrong way."
					Hardcore:
						'''
						The earliest bird of them all nabbed herself a tasty meal of {0}.
						Snacked on by a harpy, history won't remember them as any more than bird food.
						The tasty bird that ate them, at least, will make a fine meal for a hungrier pred!
						After all, most people find the thighs of a harpy the tastiest part, and those thighs'll get much larger after her meal digests...
						'''
				}
			}

			BloodMoon: {
				GroomAndBride: {
					1: "{0} will be on {1}'s stomach 'til death do them part."
					2: "{1} might not get a wedding cake, but {0} seems to have worked fine as a substitute."

					TheGroom: {
						1: "{1}'s long-decayed suit might be a bit tighter by wedding day, thanks to {0}."
						Hardcore:
							'''
							He wished to marry her one night,
							but fate tore them far apart.
							With {0} filling his stomach eternal,
							he seeks her again with his missing heart.
							'''
					}

					TheBride: {
						1: "{1}'s already-tattered wedding dress might end up bursting from her new weight, thanks to {0}."
						Hardcore:
							'''
							A bridal carry was her one concession,
							one she longed for her husband to hear.
							She now shambles in deathly depression,
							{0} forever padding out her rear.
							'''
					}
				}
			}

			Meteorite: {
				MeteorMarble: {
					1: "{0} thought a Meteor Marble was crafted well enough to feed themselves to."
					2: "{0} found a Meteor Marble that was just a little too big to handle."
					Hardcore:
						'''
						Somehow, {0} thought it was a good idea to make a Meteor Marble big enough to fit inside.
						Fitting, then, that the last moments of their only life were spent crammed into that very same Meteor Marble.
						Nobody will ever find what remains of them...for nothing does.
						'''
				}

				MeteorMaiden: {
					1: "{0} was helplessly smitten for a refueling Meteor Maiden."
					2: "{0} helped to re-energize a Meteor Maiden after a long day's work by the latter."
					3: "{0} thought a Meteor Maiden's combustion chamber looked inviting."
					4: If Meteor Maidens had a rear or thighs to add prey to, {0} would definitely be working to fatten them up right now.
					5: A Meteor Maiden saw {0} as a sufficient fuel source, and secured them for herself.
					Hardcore:
						'''
						A pleasant chime, almost like a bell mixed with a belch, but bassier and rockier, rings out over the mountaintops.
						{0} has ended up as little more than a meal for a Meteor Maiden, never to be seen again.
						Perhaps that Meteor Maiden will go on to eat a moon or seven, and countless celestial bodies beyond? Only time will tell...
						'''
				}
			}

