			3: "{0} caught a big one!"
			4: "{1} either accidentally or intentionally flattened {0}."
			5: Thanks to {1}, {0} is now equivalent to a sheet of paper.
			6: "{1} flattened {0} into a pancake."
			7: Well, good luck finding {0} under {1}'s body.
