	Clover: {
		TownNPCMood: {
			Princess_LovesNPC: "{NPCName} has cool powers and is fun to chat with! She keeps changing the topic when I ask her about it, though..."
			LikeNPC_Princess: Ah, the princess. She's fun to hang out with, but I'm kinda running out on stuff to change the topic to everytime she asks about my 'magical items', since they aren't quite...for her age.
			HateNPC: "{NPCName}..? Fuck that guy, I need my money to buy sweets!"
			LikeNPC: I like {NPCName}.
			LoveNPC: I love {NPCName}.
			HateBiome: This place, sucks. That's all there really is to say on the matter.
			DislikeBiome: I dislike {BiomeName}.
			LikeBiome: I like {BiomeName}.
			LoveBiome: It's... beautiful. Sure, the mushrooms are somewhat inedible, which is a shame, but blue is such a nice color! I love it here!!!
			HateCrowded: Wow, that's. Quite the amount of people! ...eugh.
			DislikeCrowded: Wow, that's. Quite the amount of people!
			LoveSpace: Can't complain about isolation, I guess. I'm not that good at socializing...
			FarFromHome: I think... I got lost. Whoops!
			NoHome: I have two questions. 1. Where the fuck am I? 2. Do you... have some place I can stay at?
			Content: Nothin' too crazy going on.
		}

		FreeButton.DisplayName: Free
